Text: 6 Conclusion In this paper, we use observed differences in argu- mentation styles in online debate forums to extract patterns that are highly correlated with factual and emotional argumentation. From an annotated set of forum post responses, we are able extract high- precision patterns that are associated with the argu- mentation style classes, and we are then able to use these patterns to get a larger set of indicative pat- terns using a bootstrapping methodology on a set of unannotated posts.

